er eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Popis aplikace<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"ft-ir-spektroskopie\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ft-ir-spektroskopie-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >FT-IR spektroskopie<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"popis-aplikace-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p>Ka\u017ed\u00fd, kdo n\u011bkdy pracoval s\u00a0lepidly, v\u00ed, \u017ee spr\u00e1vn\u00e9 na\u010dasov\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159i jejich v\u00fdrob\u011b i pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed je jedn\u00edm ze z\u00e1kladn\u00edch p\u0159edpoklad\u016f \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u00e9ho procesu. Pro popis jejich fungov\u00e1n\u00ed existuje \u0159ada d\u016fle\u017eit\u00fdch parametr\u016f: doba zpracovatelnosti, otev\u0159en\u00fd \u010das, \u010das pro m\u00edrn\u00e9 \u00fapravy, vytvrzovac\u00ed \u010das nebo \u010das pro dosa\u017een\u00ed maxim\u00e1ln\u00ed vazebn\u00e9 s\u00edly. Ka\u017ed\u00e9 nov\u00e9 lepidlo, kter\u00e9 m\u00e1 b\u00fdt uvedeno na trh, mus\u00ed spl\u0148ovat mnohdy n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e9 po\u017eadavky z\u00e1kazn\u00edk\u016f: nap\u0159. vyladit tzv. \u201eotev\u0159en\u00fd \u010das\u201c neboli dobu, po kterou je mo\u017en\u00e9 lepen\u00e9 d\u00edly spojit, ani\u017e by se lepidlo vytvrdilo.<\/p><figure id=\"attachment_9182\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9182\" style=\"width: 600px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9182\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/09\/028b63f0-1024x602.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"353\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/09\/028b63f0-1024x602.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/09\/028b63f0-300x176.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/09\/028b63f0-768x452.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/09\/028b63f0.jpg 1092w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9182\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Spojen\u00ed reometru <a href=\"https:\/\/www.thermofisher.com\/order\/catalog\/product\/379-0340#\/379-0340\">HAAKE MARS<\/a> a FT-IR spektrometru <a href=\"https:\/\/www.thermofisher.com\/order\/catalog\/product\/IQLAADGAAGFAHDMBKG#\/IQLAADGAAGFAHDMBKG\">Nicolet iS20<\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><strong>Reometrie<\/strong> je z\u00e1sadn\u00ed technikou nejen pro anal\u00fdzu nevytvrzen\u00e9ho lepidla, ale tak\u00e9 je d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e1 pro sledov\u00e1n\u00ed procesu vytvrzov\u00e1n\u00ed. S celou \u0159adou m\u011b\u0159ic\u00edho p\u0159\u00edslu\u0161enstv\u00ed se pro tyto \u00fa\u010dely skv\u011ble hod\u00ed <strong>reometr HAAKE MARS<\/strong> (Thermo Scientific), kter\u00fd lze nav\u00edc propojit i s dal\u0161\u00edmi p\u0159\u00edstroji: nap\u0159. s FT-IR spektrometry. Samotn\u00e1 reometrie toti\u017e dok\u00e1\u017ee odhalit, \u017ee se ve vzorku \u201en\u011bco\u201c d\u011bje, ale u\u017e neum\u00ed \u0159\u00edct pro\u010d. A pr\u00e1v\u011b v tomto okam\u017eiku je velmi v\u00fdhodn\u00e9 vyu\u017e\u00edt v\u00fdhod molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie, proto\u017ee pomoc\u00ed t\u00e9 m\u016f\u017eete analyzovat nap\u0159. zm\u011bny chemick\u00fdch vazeb, ke kter\u00fdm v procesu doch\u00e1z\u00ed, mno\u017estv\u00ed r\u016fzn\u00fdch chemick\u00fdch l\u00e1tek a \u0159adu dal\u0161\u00edch parametr\u016f.<\/p><p>Analyzovat vzorky pomoc\u00ed technik spojen\u00fdch pomoc\u00ed modulu <a href=\"https:\/\/www.thermofisher.com\/order\/catalog\/product\/603-0600#\/603-0600\"><strong>Rheonaut<\/strong><\/a> m\u00e1 nav\u00edc tu v\u00fdhodu, \u017ee m\u011b\u0159\u00edte \u00fadaje z\u00a0jednoho bodu vzorku ve stejn\u00fd \u010das, a tak\u00e9 umo\u017e\u0148uje p\u0159esnou kontrolu teploty p\u0159i m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed.<\/p>                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"ft-ir-spektroskopie-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"ft-ir-spektroskopie-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <style>@media(max-width:1024px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 20px 0px;}}@media(max-width:767px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 15px 0px;}}<\/style>\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"section\" data-elementor-id=\"5032\" class=\"elementor elementor-5032\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-66c51c3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"66c51c3\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-34ebf637\" data-id=\"34ebf637\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dce-fix-ba